<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--St Martin Hospital Services, La., $2.35 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Charles Stewart College, Mich., $6.025 million GO improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--New Hope-Solebury School District, Pa., $22.515 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
